%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: HighHrothgar3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487864
    - rid: 4351268055900487865
    - rid: 4351268055900487866
    - rid: 4351268055900487867
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17d7fb6524a48624b8f800e8b355e0ad, type: 2}
    dialog: ... You are now ready for your last trial.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487868
    - rid: 4351268055900487870
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Get the Horn of Jurgen Windcaller?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17d7fb6524a48624b8f800e8b355e0ad, type: 2}
    dialog: ... how did you know?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487871
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I know lots of things.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I also know that it isn't in Ustengrav.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487872
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17d7fb6524a48624b8f800e8b355e0ad, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean? That's where it was laid to rest-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well yeah, but someone got it first. So it's not there anymore.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But don't worry, I know who has it now.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 17d7fb6524a48624b8f800e8b355e0ad, type: 2}
    dialog: ... uh, well... just get the Horn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487876
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Let's head out, Monika.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487873
    - rid: 4351268055900487874
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So who has the horn now?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487875
    - rid: 4351268055900487877
    - rid: 4351268055900487878
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: You and Natsuki delivered the Dragonstone back to Farengar, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, yeah, we did do that.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you talk to a hooded woman there?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: There <i>was</i> a hooded woman there, but we didn't really talk to her-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487880
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: She has the horn?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yep.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487882
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, where is she?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487883
    - rid: 4351268055900487884
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Running <i>The Sleeping Giant</i> back in Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487885
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So we're just walking all the way back to Riverwood?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487886
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, better that than walking to Ustengrav and <i>then</i> walking back
      to Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487887
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Could we at least get some transport, or something?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487888
    - rid: 4351268055900487889
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Like a horse?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487890
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: That'd work!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487891
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Horses cost 1000 septims each.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487892
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: A bit of a long shot, but please tell me there's a cheaper option...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487893
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Well, I''m pretty sure there''s only two free horses in all of Skyrim:'
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487894
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Shadowmere and Arvak.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487895
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So how do we get them?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, to get Shadowmere, someone would have to join the Dark Brotherhood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487896
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And Arvak is in the Soul Cairn, which is in a separate plane of existence
      entirely; the Soul Cairn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: To get there you have to either be undead, or have your soul partially
      trapped.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, a bit out of the way on our journey to Riverwood.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487897
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anything else completely out of reach that I should know about?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487899
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Lore-wise, I'm pretty sure airships are a thing. Which would be nice
      to have.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: What do you mean you're pretty sure?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487898
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think the only one that exists in-game is a crashed Dwemer airship,
      but I remember other people using them too, even in the Third era.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Even if we got one, would we be able to fly it?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487900
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you've got a driver's license, right?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You're funny.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487901
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And you're funny lookin'.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487905
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You stink, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268055900487906
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I mean, I haven't showered since I got here, so... yeah?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678451
    - rid: 4351268081624678452
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Please tell me we won't be doing anything else today...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678453
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: By the time we arrived to Riverwood, it had gotten pretty late.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, we could stay the night here.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678454
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The next step in the main quest is really out of the way, depending on
      what we want to skip to.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Skip to?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678455
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, a good portion of the second act of the main quest is about gathering
      information relating to the return of the dragons and how to stop them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which, duh, I already know the answers to.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678456
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So where would be heading to next?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678457
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, the fastest route would probably be to head up to Alftand to get
      the Elder Scroll from there-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678458
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And, once we have it, convince the Graybeards to let us see Partysnax.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Partysnax, {mc}?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678459
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, that's just a silly name for Paarthur-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678460
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: You're that visitor, been pokin' around...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678466
    - rid: 4351268081624678467
    - rid: 4351268081624678468
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: ... uh huh.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'd like to rent the attic room, please.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678469
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Attic room? {mc}, we can literally see the roof from here-)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678470
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm well aware. And so is she.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678471
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: The... attic room?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, we don't have an attic room, but we do have a one that's free right
      now. Follow me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678472
    - rid: 4351268081624678473
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: She's someone you trust?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Trust enough for what's coming next? Yes.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Close that door behind you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I do as instructed, closing the room's door.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Uh, {mc}, where is this going...?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678474
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Through that wardrobe.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678475
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Delphine opens up the wardrobe, moving its sliding back out of the way
      to get access to the secret basement room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Come on through.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678476
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678477
    - rid: 4351268081624678480
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: So, which one of you is the dragonborn?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678481
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That'd be me.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The horn, please.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Of course. Here you are:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Delphine hands me the Horn of Jurgen Windcaller.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you get this anyway? The puzzles were set up to require the use
      of the Whirlwind Sprint shout.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ... I have my ways.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, okay.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, I'm not going to Kynesgrove with you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Uh, what?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: How did you-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The Septim emperors'' dragon blood let them scry into the future with
      their dreams, and I <i>am</i> dragonborn too... '
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Is my foresight really that unexpected?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Um. You can't really read the future, right? You're just giving an excuse,
      right?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678482
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: (Nope. Just trying to be as convincing as possible, since I don't want
      to waste any of our time.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678483
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: There's other ways to divine the future! Just being able to do that doesn't
      make you dragonborn-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Hm. Did you not hear my voice echoing from High Hrothgar?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ...!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: That <i>was</i> your voice, wasn't it...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: That just means you've been trained in the Thu'um, anyone could do tha-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Delphine. How old do you think I am?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: Well, you're quite young, barely a man-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: So, would I have had the time to learn such a shout, that even the Graybeards
      didn't know about?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678484
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Because the shout <i>I</i> used was one I just made up.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: The only way to know for sure is to see you eat a dragon's soul-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Which people have. Ask any of the guards in Whiterun who were there fighting
      that dragon.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Look, I appreciate your paranoia being a learned survival strategy-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678485
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: But you're just wasting both of our times.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: I...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly, I came here just for the horn.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: There is nothing else you could offer me, in fact I'm pretty sure I've
      got more that I could give you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: You... you're just letting your power get to your head!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678486
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And you're just saying that because your plans don't work without my
      help.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'Look, I''ll tell you the important stuff that I would be finding out
      for you anyway:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The Thalmor don't know anything about the dragons, Alduin's arrival at
      Helgen was a convenient coincidence for them.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Esbern's hiding down in the depths of the Ratway in Riften.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: He'll probably want to go to Cloud Ruler Temple in the Reach, which you
      won't be able to get into without my blood.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The mural, Alduin's Wall, is in there describing that I need to learn
      the Dragonrend shout to defeat Alduin.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And finally, I'm not going to help you restore the Blades. That's your
      problem, not mine.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678487
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I hand Delphine 10 septims.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268081624678488
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: This is for another room, I trust there'll be one available for me?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5dbdbe635e2cd084781e20280212a995, type: 2}
    dialog: ... yeah. It'll be the one straight ahead from this room.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Thank you.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Good night, Delphine.
    ScreenActions: []
